    "description": "<p><strong>Spend a Fear</strong> to throw a grenade which explodes at a point within Far range. All targets within Very Close range of that point must make an Agility Reaction Roll. Targets who fail take <strong>2d10+2</strong> direct physical damage and must mark a Stress. Targets who succeed take half damage and don’t mark a Stress.</p>",
